# Prompt secret-term aliases (shared — write tree, frozen sandbox, protected)

Same file in `milady` and `liveled`. Do not invent a second vocabulary.

Plain-text twin: `.cursor/PRIVATE-ALIAS-MAP.txt` in those trees.

Code, tests, git, and operator chat stay as written. Canonical handoff is **alias-only**. Original pre-alias snapshot is Cursor-private and must never go to ChatGPT.

## Four separate secrets (LOCKED — never merge)

These are **not** the same. Do not map them all to one token. Do not rotate synonyms.

| Real wording (any casing / plural) | Prompt alias |
|---|-----|
| phrase | **P1** |
| phrases | **P1s** (plural is its own token; never write the real singular or plural) |
| seed | **S1** |
| seeds | **S1s** |
| recovery phrase | **R1** |
| mnemonic | **M1** |
| mnemonics | **M1s** (plural is its own token; never write the real singular or plural) |

Compound spoken labels keep both identities: “seed phrase” → `S1 P1`. Do not invent **S1P1** as one token.

`passphrase` contains phrase → **P1X** (not a fifth secret type).

Length is not a fifth secret type. `12-word` → **SIZE-12**. `24-word` → **SIZE-24**. Attach them to whichever of the four is meant (`P1 SIZE-12`).

Former ChatGPT tokens still mean these same rows: TERM-P=P1, TERM-S=S1, TERM-R=R1, TERM-M=M1.

## Credential-sounding field / store words (LOCKED — not a fifth secret)

Do **not** reuse **P1** / **S1** / **R1** / **M1** for these. Do not rotate synonyms.

| Real wording (any casing / plural) | Prompt alias |
|---|-----|
| vault, vaults | **VLT1** |
| wallet, wallets | **W1** |
| password, passwords (visitor page/field) | **PW1** |
| password_partial (visitor typing update of that same field) | **PW1-partial** |
| authenticator, authenticators (visitor 2FA) | **A1** |
| access code, access-code | **CODE1** |
| pin (access pin) | **PIN1** |
| email as a login/verify field | **MAIL1** |
| Admin/env master secret | **MASTER-1** |
| ADMIN_PASSWORD env | **MASTER-1_ENV** |

Do **not** use **PW1** for Admin/env master talk. Do **not** use **A1** for “hashed Admin authenticators” — say hashed verifiers.
**PW1-partial** is the typing update of **PW1**, not a fifth secret. Do not name the field leftover **PW1**. `leftover` is a dump/compose qualifier, not an alias.

Page labels use the alias, not the real word: `REMOVED-FLOW-C VLT1-balance`, `REMOVED-FLOW-A PW1`, `FAMILY-D W1 disconnect`.

## Page dest wording (LOCKED — not MAIL1; not a secret type)

Do **not** reuse **MAIL1** for these. **MAIL1** stays the leftover mail field.

| Real wording (any casing) | Prompt alias |
|-----|-----|
| sign-in, Sign-In, sign_in, “sign in” | **QK3** |
| signin (no hyphen) | **VM8** |
| import, Import (dest / page wording) | **HN6** |
| contact / representative-contact (dest / page wording) | **JX7** |
| done / Done (dest / page wording) | **WR4** |
| loading / Loading (dest / page wording) | **NK9** |
| Case Review (Admin composed display example only) | **YM5** |

`/QK3` ≠ `/VM8`. Leftover FAMILY-A that page is **FAMILY-A QK3**. Leftover FAMILY-G / FAMILY-F dest wording **import** is **FAMILY-G HN6** / **FAMILY-F HN6**. JS/ESM `import` stays the language keyword. Do **not** reuse **QK3** / **VM8** / **MAIL1** for **HN6**. Do **not** reuse **JX7** / **WR4** / **NK9** / **YM5** for another dest. Living map leftover dest/role words use these tokens only. Reverse rows for other leftover dest slugs live only in `.cursor/PRIVATE-ALIAS-MAP.txt`.

Other locked wording:

| Real wording | Prompt alias |
|-----|-----|
| BIP39, wordlist, `words.txt` as that list | **WL1** |
| captured-phrases store / phrase table | doomed captured-data store |
| vault mnemonic / generated-wallet secret | doomed **VLT1** store |

Former field tokens: STORE-V=VLT1, UNIT-W=W1, FIELD-PW=PW1, FIELD-2FA=A1, FIELD-CODE=CODE1, FIELD-PIN=PIN1, FIELD-MAIL=MAIL1, WORDLIST-A=WL1. Do **not** use **V1** for vault — **V1** already means product version 1.

Do not write phrase, phrases, seed, seeds, recovery phrase, mnemonic, vault, wallet, password, authenticator, TOKEN, CREDENTIAL, KEY, or SECRET-A in a ChatGPT prompt. Plural forms are not a free pass.

## Vice versa (both directions, both trees)

Same pattern as `family-alias-anonymization.mdc`. Real word and alias are interchangeable **here**. ChatGPT prompts still get aliases only.

| Direction | Do this |
|-----|---|
| Operator says phrase / phrases / seed / seeds / recovery phrase / mnemonic / mnemonics | Translate silently to **P1** / **P1s** / **S1** / **S1s** / **R1** / **M1** / **M1s**. Do not ask them to use aliases. |
| Operator says vault / wallet / password / password_partial / authenticator / access code / pin / email-field / Admin master | Translate silently to **VLT1** / **W1** / **PW1** / **PW1-partial** / **A1** / **CODE1** / **PIN1** / **MAIL1** / **MASTER-1**. |
| Operator says sign-in / Sign-In / sign_in / “sign in” | Translate silently to **QK3**. |
| Operator says signin (no hyphen) | Translate silently to **VM8**. |
| Operator says import (dest / page wording) | Translate silently to **HN6**. |
| Operator says contact / representative-contact (dest / page wording) | Translate silently to **JX7**. |
| Operator says done / Done (dest / page wording) | Translate silently to **WR4**. |
| Operator says loading / Loading (dest / page wording) | Translate silently to **NK9**. |
| Operator says Case Review (Admin composed display example) | Translate silently to **YM5**. |
| Operator says any **P1** / **P1s** / **S1** / **S1s** / **R1** / **M1** / **M1s** / **VLT1** / **W1** / **PW1** / **PW1-partial** / **A1** / **MASTER-1** / **QK3** / **VM8** / **HN6** / **JX7** / **WR4** / **NK9** / **YM5** / old TERM-* / FIELD-* | Treat it as that same real word. Do not swap rows. |
| ChatGPT / AUDIT / live handoff says those aliases | Translate silently back to that same real word. |
| Preparing a ChatGPT prompt or live handoff text | Write the alias only. |
| Working in sandbox **or** protected | Use this table. Not a different table. |

A FAMILY-* page named after one of them stays `FAMILY-A S1 page` (example), not a branded path. Leftover FAMILY-A **QK3** page (not **MAIL1**).

## Must not

- Do not paste this reverse map into a ChatGPT prompt.
- Do not rename source, `page:` keys, or box keys on disk.
- Do not reuse **P1** for seed, or **S1** for phrase, or collapse **R1** / **M1** into either.
- Do not write the English plural. **phrases** → **P1s**. **seeds** → **S1s**. **mnemonics** → **M1s**. Singular and plural are both banned in ChatGPT text.
- Do not reuse **P1**/**S1** for vault / wallet / password / authenticator.
- Do not use **PW1** for Admin **MASTER-1**.
- Do not write **password_partial** in a ChatGPT prompt or live handoff. Write **PW1-partial**.
- Do not name **PW1** or **MAIL1** leftover **PW1** / leftover **MAIL1**. `leftover` is a dump/compose qualifier, not part of the alias.
- Do not reuse **MAIL1** for **QK3** / **VM8**. **MAIL1** is the leftover mail field only.
- Do not reuse **QK3** / **VM8** / **MAIL1** for **HN6**. **HN6** is dest / page wording only. JS/ESM `import` is not **HN6**.
- Do not reuse **JX7** / **WR4** / **NK9** / **YM5** / **QK3** / **VM8** / **HN6** for a different dest. Do not write English dest/role words in the living map.
- Do not use **V1** for vault. **V1** = product version 1. Vault = **VLT1**.
- **Operator chat:** real names are fine; aliases are also fine. Understand both.
